In a remarkable about face, Nvidia &#x2019;s board today announced that effective immediately, Jensen Huang has been reinstated as President and Chief Executive Officer and as a member of the Board.

The Board of Directors said it voted unanimously to reinstate Huang following a series of discussions and meetings with the founder of the tech giant &#x201C;after which the Board was satisfied with respect to Mr. Huang&#x2019;s candor and ability to lead NVIDIA.&#x201D;

